   "text": {
    "en": "1. These Rules may be cited as the Land Revenue Collection (Fees) Rules."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "SG-H2943-A2",
   "no": 2,
   "noLabel": {
    "en": "2."
   },
   "heading": {
    "en": "Fees"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "2.—(1) The following fees shall be payable under the Act:\n(a) for service of a notice of demand\n$20\n(b) for service of a notice of sale\n$30.\n(2) A Collector of Land Revenue may remit or refund, wholly or in part, any fee paid or payable under paragraph (1).\n[S 311/2015 wef 01/06/2015]"
   }
